          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "This dataset contains the effects from robots (R) and IT (IT) on taxes (lnT) and labor (lnL) using firm-level data (Orbis Europe) for the period 2007-2016 in regional regressions at the NUTS0, NUTS2 and NUTS3 level."
